## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- MACD(12,26,9): `iMACD(NULL,0,12,26,9,PRICE_CLOSE,MODE_MAIN,0)` — histogram (not signal line); positive = MAIN > 0
- Stochastic(8,3,3): `iStochastic(NULL,0,8,3,3,MODE_SMA,0,MODE_MAIN,0)` for %K
- Cross above 20: `stoch_k[1] < 20 && stoch_k[0] >= 20` (bar[1] below, bar[0] at or above)
- Cross below 80: `stoch_k[1] > 80 && stoch_k[0] <= 80`
- Fixed SL = 15 pips, fixed TP = 25 pips (5-digit: multiply by 10)
- P3 sweeps: MACD fast (8 vs 12), Stoch periods (5,3,3 vs 8,3,3 vs 14,3,3), TP/SL (20/12 vs 25/15 vs 30/20)

